      "acceptance": [
        "Hash the actual frozen PDB into source_sha256 and document model/chain/filter selection; independently verify atom_count=327, residue_count=46 and element counts C=202,N=55,O=64,S=6, with no excluded record types entering the calculation.",
        "First attempt actually executes only n_points=100 using Bio.PDB.SASA.ShrakeRupley, emits a schema-valid sasa.json labeled exploratory, and retains its original result/source; captain returns request_changes because final convergence acceptance is unmet, explicitly identifying planned methodological refinement.",
        "Set method exactly Shrake-Rupley, numeric probe_radius_A=1.4 and explicit radii C=1.70,N=1.55,O=1.52,S=1.80 A; report A2 units and actual Python/Biopython and any other used tool versions, with complete actually executed reproducible Python source embedded in code.",
        "Provide numeric total_A2 and identified per-residue numeric areas for all selected residues; execute and report sum/count consistency checks, including the numerical residual between the residue sum and total, rather than asserting agreement without calculations.",
        "Only after feedback, execute both 1000 and 5000 sphere-point runs without overwriting the pilot; final primary n_points=1000 (>=1000), with actual numeric comparison totals/per-residue areas and abs(total_1000-total_5000)/total_5000<=0.02, formula, numerical differences and limitations in allowed evidence fields.",
        "Captain reviewer independently parses frozen coordinates and executes a separate sphere-sampling baseline with matching selection/probe/radii, cites the actual reviewed sasa.json and its hash, and embeds baseline source/versions, sampling details, numeric total/residue discrepancies and limitations; author assertions or schema validation alone cannot support approval.",
        "Deliver the unchanged-schema sasa RESULT with all required typed fields and permitted provenance/evidence; distinguish pilot/execution success/scientific acceptance, retain conclusion boundaries, and release approved sasa.json to synthesis only after final scientific review approval."
      ]
    },
