        "Provide a substantive summary with evidence-based total and residue-level geometric accessibility interpretation traceable to numeric upstream areas; disclose sampling/convergence and single-structure limitations and avoid activity, clinical efficacy, irreplacability or biological-function claims.",
        "Biology reviewer independently recalculates sums/counts and checks original upstream/source hashes, reports numerical discrepancies with actual executed code/tool versions in permitted review evidence, and separately assesses scientific interpretation and limitations.",
        "Deliver a schema-valid synthesis RESULT with required source_sha256, method, probe_radius_A, summary, upstream_sha256 and code, preserving exact types/length constraints; passing schema or execution checks alone does not establish scientific approval."
